# The build context is deliberately narrow.
#
# The most important line here is content/products/. Those are the files
# customers pay for. They belong in the volume on the server, put there by hand,
# never baked into an image that could be pushed to a registry.

.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The paid product files. See above.
content/products/

# Working files that have no business in a running container.
reports/
*.log
*.zip
*.csv
_*.mjs
